      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "果然，在三后冠的战线上\n战胜景致小姐，才是通往异世界的钥匙。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4319ffb6e0290fd54ca9aac0f5ec4cb32404b61844662f6b59cc53cab0545020",
