      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……直到此时此刻之前，我都没有察觉到。\n我原以为，\n您只是为了回应人们的期待才奔跑的……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f3ef93148116d4eb3eb4773c27ed63e0b193d65fbbfa7be3c9350485148a089",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
