      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "红色梦想迅速斩断了在『樱花赏』中留下的遗憾，\n目光已经重新投向了前方。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1fea2a3568a884bafb28e5f721049b9a1b54da16bc5e3e440e73a4c8e49ab635",
